  sing-box v1.14.4
  Copyright (C) 2022 nekohasekai and contributors
  Licensed under GPL-3.0
  Source: https://github.com/SagerNet/sing-box/tree/v1.14.4

The exact build tags and source revision used for each release are published in
scripts/build-core.sh, the release SBOM and the core manifest. No upstream
source files are modified; only Go build tags are selected.

